<title>USA: United Meridian names James Dunlap president.</title>
<headline>United Meridian names James Dunlap president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Meridian Corp said on Thursday that it named James Dunlap as president and chief operating officer and a member of the company's board.  </p>
<p>Dunlap replaces Donald Wolf, who resigned to maintain his long-time residence in Denver, Colorado.</p>
<p>United Meridian is a Houston-based independent energy company engaged in the exploration and acquisition of natural gas and crude oil properties in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
